{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Girl's Kidnapping Case in Your Neighborhood...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Choices and Actions Determine the Outcome</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, feeling that life is dull, lives the same monotonous days.<br>They are informed that an acquaintance's child has gone missing in the neighborhood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story branches based on your choices and actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration phase where you control the player, and a novel phase that advances the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 endings (including 2 secret endings).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story that can be completed in about 5-10 minutes until the ending, making it easy to replay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of games where choices lead to branching stories and different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovers of visual novel or sound novel games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy quick, bite-sized gaming experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who love collecting multiple endings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is displayed only in Japanese.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are limited to mouse and keyboard.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982780?t=1762131646","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982780/189c9d11f4e42958b71ccdc86ce6d58e5d2d00ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762131646","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/